# Build contexts that use the repo root (offloader/Dockerfile, collector/Dockerfile) only copy
# offloader/, collector/ and the probe image. Everything else (results, archives, .venv, .git, ...)
# can be tens of GB and must not be sent to the Docker daemon.
*
!offloader/
!collector/
!apps/pedestrian-detection/images/bus.jpg
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
